{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-18","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平面与角与线段","englishTitle":"If a straight line be at right angles to any plane, all the planes through it will also be at right angles to the same plane.","book":11,"number":18,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.18","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.18/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":18,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-18@raw-3ead96c6f4e7b3f1","contentId":"euclid-11-18","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3ead96c6f4e7b3f1b597c48b25f0052c8523b49fb724028ce50aa36ba976983b","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-18.statement","euclid-11-18.construction.1","euclid-11-18.construction.2","euclid-11-18.proof.1","euclid-11-18.proof.2","euclid-11-18.proof.3","euclid-11-18.proof.4","euclid-11-18.proof.5","euclid-11-18.proof.6","euclid-11-18.conclusion","euclid-11-18.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-18.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-18","revisionId":"euclid-11-18@raw-3ead96c6f4e7b3f1","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3e3d7757e309956ff7d905f819d2be083a1ce38c1552a5b17ba19f8ba1e7458d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a straight line be at right angles to any plane, all the planes through it will also be at right angles to the same plane."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果直线为直角至平面,则通过该直线的平面也将为直角至平面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-18.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-18","revisionId":"euclid-11-18@raw-3ead96c6f4e7b3f1","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a6247fb706bf4029e01d3a0312f0c989b58bc4b8dc9166a17fc482af834e56cf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let any straight line AB be at right angles to the plane of reference; I say that all the planes through AB are also at right angles to the plane of reference."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"任何一条AB直线,在直角至平面参考线之间;我说,所有平面至AB直线,在直角至平面参考线之间。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-18.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-18","revisionId":"euclid-11-18@raw-3ead96c6f4e7b3f1","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cb328e75182e647676ecfc9c382ccfe68a91864cc59148e9a95c0a3a93447141","citations":["euclid-1-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the plane DE be drawn through AB, let CE be the common section of the plane DE and the plane of reference, let a point F be taken at random on CE, and from F let FG be drawn in the plane DE at right angles to CE. [[I. 11](/principles/euclid-1-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将平面 DE拖到AB,将CE拖到平面 DE和平面参照标准的共同部分,将CE拖到CE,将F拖到F,直角至CE平面 DE。（相关点与线段：FG） [[I. 11](/principles/euclid-1-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-18.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-18","revisionId":"euclid-11-18@raw-3ead96c6f4e7b3f1","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d2a0fd259c038dbf5462e6842c888501f25c24e28ea137f170c2aa7f06207f05","citations":["euclid-11-def-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since AB is at right angles to the plane of reference, AB is also at right angles to all the straight lines which meet it and are in the plane of reference; [[XI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-11-def-3)] so that it is also at right angles to CE; therefore the angle ABF is right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于AB是直角,参考值为平面,AB也是直角,相交线为平面;因此,角度ABF是正确的。（相关点与线段：CE） [[XI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-11-def-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-18.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-18","revisionId":"euclid-11-18@raw-3ead96c6f4e7b3f1","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"14397444da5f1adae6eef223aee78ad1befd01373ea5383d1bbe32db67a48814","citations":["euclid-1-28"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle GFB is also right; therefore AB is parallel to FG. [[I. 28](/principles/euclid-1-28)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但GFB的角度也是正确的,因此AB与FG平行。 [[I. 28](/principles/euclid-1-28)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-18.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-18","revisionId":"euclid-11-18@raw-3ead96c6f4e7b3f1","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8de72234a2659f15b70b6b47632a1ab1f7ea1242895d106f675a6f9d8b061bc7","citations":["euclid-11-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AB is at right angles to the plane of reference; therefore FG is also at right angles to the plane of reference. [[XI. 8](/principles/euclid-11-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AB是直角,参考值为平面;因此,FG也是直角,参考值为平面。 [[XI. 8](/principles/euclid-11-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-18.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-18","revisionId":"euclid-11-18@raw-3ead96c6f4e7b3f1","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"511ab5363ab43bcea7ea6535c3a70bd4b3d23856515934afc5797dd290713c27","citations":["euclid-11-def-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now a plane is at right angles to a plane, when the straight lines drawn, in one of the planes, at right angles to the common section of the planes are at right angles to the remaining plane. [[XI. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-11-def-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"平面是直角到平面,平面的直线线线是平面的一条直线,平面的直角到其余的平面。 [[XI. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-11-def-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-18.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-11-18","revisionId":"euclid-11-18@raw-3ead96c6f4e7b3f1","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"715a853b158d75a8531e97458718384e861075e2f48bdb382f8d05b5ca4ec08b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And FG, drawn in one of the planes DE at right angles to CE, the common section of the planes, was proved to be at right angles to the plane of reference; therefore the plane DE is at right angles to the plane of reference."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FG, 由平面 DE 时的直角 至 CE中之一抽取, 平面 时的通用部分被证明为 直角 时的平面; 因此, 平面 DE 时的直角 时的平面 时的平面 时的平面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-18.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-11-18","revisionId":"euclid-11-18@raw-3ead96c6f4e7b3f1","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8f88fab3f0ff06065100b2964e808e2c28e7f5ce5d771a76fadd3068996a9afd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly also it can be proved that all the planes through AB are at right angles to the plane of reference."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,可以证明,平面至AB的所有时间为直角至平面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-18.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-18","revisionId":"euclid-11-18@raw-3ead96c6f4e7b3f1","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-18.source","contentId":"euclid-11-18","revisionId":"euclid-11-18@raw-3ead96c6f4e7b3f1","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"076c923800b2d2aeb8f1417a501b79c8519e13ef8ea5062c94785ba2394c18e9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.18/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.18\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-18:euclid-1-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-18","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-18.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.18","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.18/","sourceLabel":"I. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-18:euclid-11-def-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-18","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-18.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-def-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2: